              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndababgira ukuri yuk’ umuntu wese yobgira uyu musozi, ati Shingūka utabge mu kiyaga: ntabikekeranye mu mutima, arikw akizera yukw ico avuze gikorwa, azokibona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
